    "content": "| 文档更新日期 | \r\n|\r\n-------- |\r\n| 2023.3.7   | \r\n\r\n#  一、功能解析\r\n##   **1. 排除已转化用户**\r\n\r\n设置“排除已转化用户”后，系统将自动依照当前营销选择的优化目标作为排除的转化，投放营销不会曝光给所选范围内已转化的用户。\r\n转化默认将排除您所选的oCPC/oCPM优化目标，同时也支持您自定义选择需要排除的转化行为。对于「同商品」维度，仅支持默认排除「下单」和「付费」两种转化，暂不支持自定义转化。\r\n\r\n\r\n##  **2. 在实时性方面**\r\n\r\n\r\n「排除已转化用户」定向能小时级排除掉您上报的一方行为数据和归因到营销上的转化数据。避免了您通过「人群提取-等待人群生效-绑包投放-定期更新」等传统通路的冗长操作，仅需在腾讯营销投放平台一键选择，即可实时生效。系统会严格做好一方数据的隔离，保障您的转化不会被用于其他方。\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n##   **3. 功能已全量发布**\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n# 二、功能枚举值介绍\r\n已转化用户指已经在营销、商品、应用上产生过转化的用户。其中，营销上的已转化用户，支持同计划、同账户营销、同商务管家、同主体等维度下的聚合。\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n</p>\r\n<table>\r\n    <colgroup>\r\n        <col style=\"width: 134px\" width=\"134px\"/>\r\n        <col style=\"width: 472px\" width=\"472px\"/>\r\n    </colgroup>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr style=\"height: 27px;\" class=\"firstRow\">\r\n            <td style=\"background: rgb(233, 233, 233); border-color: rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px 4px 3px;\" width=\"134\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"\" valign=\"\">\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-center pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: transparent; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">枚举值</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: transparent; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td style=\"background: rgb(233, 233, 233); border-color: rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px 4px 3px;\" width=\"472\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"\" valign=\"\">\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-center pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: transparent; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">能力介绍</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: transparent; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\r\n            <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-color: rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px 4px 3px;\" width=\"134\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"\" valign=\"\">\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">同计划营销</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-color: rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px 4px 3px;\" width=\"472\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"\" valign=\"\">\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">共享相同营销主题和预算的营销集合，即排除同一个营销推广计划下的已转化用户。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\r\n            <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-color: rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px 4px 3px;\" width=\"134\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"\" valign=\"\">\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">同账户营销</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-color: rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px 4px 3px;\" width=\"472\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"\" valign=\"\">\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">排除同一个客户投放账户下的对应的转化行为</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\r\n            <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-color: rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px 4px 3px;\" width=\"134\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"\" valign=\"\">\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">同商务管家营销</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-color: rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px 4px 3px;\" width=\"472\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"\" valign=\"\">\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"