r\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">仅支持商品营销-单商品营销时，可选择「同商品」维度。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n                </p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-0pt pap-spacing-after-6pt\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">注：</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">默认</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">排除</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">近30天</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">的已转化用户，暂时不支持选择排除的时间窗。对于极少量有过多转化行为的用户，可能会出现排除未生效的情况。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    <br/>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n# 三、使用指引\r\n## 1.腾讯营销投放平台操作流程\r\n### 1.1. 您在营销创建流程的「定向模块」中，可以选择定向「排除已转化用户」\r\n\r\n![444.png](https://bbx-pic.gtimg.com/bbx/pictures/2023/211_20231012164437_334882.png)\r\n### 1.2. 定向使用方式\r\n\r\n● 当选择排除维度（「同商品」除外）时，若使用默认转化行为，则仅支持ocpc/ocpm出价方式，即默认排除优化目标中的转化行为。\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://bbx-pic.gtimg.com/bbx/pictures/2023/285_20231014022336_239253.png\" target=\"_self\" style=\"text-align: center;\"> <img src=\"https://bbx-pic.gtimg.com/bbx/pictures/2023/285_20231014022336_239253.png\" /></a>\r\n● 当选择排除维度（「同商品」除外）时，可开启「自定义转化行为」，支持指定您自定义排除的任意转化，即选择自定义转化行为时支持所有出价方式。\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://bbx-pic.gtimg.com/bbx/pictures/2023/285_20231014152821_703758.png\" target=\"_self\" style=\"text-align: center;\"> <img src=\"https://bbx-pic.gtimg.com/bbx/pictures/2023/285_20231014152821_703758.png\" /></a>\r\n\r\n● 当选择「同商品」维度时，仅支持默认排除「下单」和「付费」两种转化，暂不支持自定义转化，同时支持所有出价方式。\r\n<a href=\"https://bbx-pic.gtimg.com/bbx/pictures/2023/211_20231012164631_845938.png\" target=\"_self\" style=\"text-align: center;\"> <img src=\"https://bbx-pic.gtimg.com/bbx/pictures/2023/211_20231012164631_845938.png\" style='width:600px' /></a>\r\n## 2. Marketing API指引\r\n涉及接口：adgroups/add、 adgroups/update、adgroups/get\r\n\r\n\r\n涉及字段：排除已转化用户定向（excluded_converted_audience）\r\n\r\n\r\nAPI地址：https://developers.e.qq.com/docs/api/adsmanagement/adgroups/adgroups_add?version=1.1&_preview=1\r\n\r\n\r\nAPI功能已全量发布",
